  CardStory: "2Spade feels her arms squeezing under his diaphragm.\r\n\r\nThe blockage
    is dislodged. Sweet, cool air rushes in. 2Spade notices the arms that saved him
    are still there. They belong to 2Club. Of course. She is always there, when he
    needs her. Both smile. *There are many exhalations from the rest of those present.
    But oxygen is apparently essential for continued function.*\r\n\r\n*I remark
    on it.* Her eyes widen and her lips press closer. *That means the words I chose
    are out of context.* She asks what 2Spade is talking about. 2Spade laughs weakly,
    brushing off her concern. \r\n\r\nThere is laughter as 5Club jokes about their
    proximity. *I\u2019m aware of 2Spade\u2019s sensation at the words, not dissimilar
    to his reaction to harm.*\r\n\r\nBack at the barracks, 2Spade sleeps."
